# In new syntax, bare identifiers in value position are variable references.
# File paths and strings with special chars must be quoted.
["hello" "some.file.txt" "path/to/file" "my-key" "email@example.com" "config..bak"]
=== out
["hello"  "some.file.txt"  "path/to/file"  "my-key"  "email@example.com"  "config..bak"]
